n this asset class, liquidity tier, and creation/redemption mechanics? Who is staffed on the account, and what continuity plan exists if key people leave? What measurable results (spreads, depth, time at the NBBO) can be reported?\n\n**Capital and seed support:** Is the seed temporary market-maker inventory? If so, what is the unwind plan and timing? Will the market maker keep quoting after seed is withdrawn? Which investor assets are expected to last, and what drives their retention? Are there volume-linked payments, rebates, or fee-sharing that could create incentives? What are the termination terms, and how would spreads be affected on exit?\n\nThese are suggested lines of inquiry, not mandatory approval criteria.","ttft_ms":2022,"type":"result","duration_ms":2964,"uuid":"c8b2d0ea-3fa4-45d0-aa9c-04e5861c638c","ttft_stream_ms":400,"time_to_request_ms":51,"first_content_frame_ms":400,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
